    "body": "Hey there,\n\nThe issue is that the only provided info there is as follows:\ndictionary WorkerOptions {\n  WorkerType type = \"classic\";\n  RequestCredentials credentials = \"omit\"; // credentials is only used if type is \"module\"\n};\n\nIt doesn't explain all the possible options and the differences + use cases / demos.\n\nMaybe I can't find all the info I need, but this has been one endless jumping from one document to the other for me.\n",
