    "updated_at": "2016-03-28T09:22:19Z",
    "body": "Yeah, I agree it's hard to figure out the semantics without reading all the linked algorithms. We should add some green boxes (domintro) that explain the basics. See https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/608 for some discussion on this feature from when it was added.\n",
